      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-22T17:27:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Coming up with a general case workaround is probably overkill here, but I can just rewrite the code to use swizzles here instead like the OP suggested and leave the uniform as-is.",
      "parentUuid": "968a2787_a23e5272",
      "revId": "ef3db3b50efe5fe8c4abc033b3c6e966e5848735",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
