      "writtenOn": "2022-07-22T18:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Filed http://skbug.com/13559 to generalize this to a GLSL backend rewrite. Thinking about it some more, the \"incurs overhead\" case should be rare. It\u0027ll only add a temp variable if the inner expression is non-trivial.\n\nAll the same, I think it\u0027s harmless/mildly beneficial to land this now; I\u0027d rather emit the SkSL we like, than rely on a rewrite to convert it.",
      "parentUuid": "1d3ebafd_f27696a9",
